id: pm-rl-p401
title: Refuse to rank the incomparable rather than warn about it
description: "Two checkpoints evaluated under two environment versions are not comparable, and a benchmark whose tasks overlap the training environment's task suite yields a flattering score. A leaderboard that mixes either case silently launders a version change or a contamination into an apparent improvement. Warnings are ignored, so both cases exit non-zero. Because an extension handler cannot both return a report and exit non-zero, the refusal must throw, and the remediation has to be folded into the message since a thrown error's remediation field is replaced by a generic host line."
type: Decision
status: closed
priority: 2
